text":"用命令行新建项目","fontFamily":"Microsoft YaHei","fontSize":13,"lineHeight":1.3,"color":"#3E4845","align":["left","top"]}},{"elementId":"code2-bg","elementType":"shape","shapeName":"rect","bounds":[480,262,424,46],"fill":{"type":"solid","color":"#1F2A27"}},{"elementId":"code2","elementType":"text","bounds":[496,270,400,30],"content":{"text":"node packages/core/huandeng.js init Talks/Lab --title Lab","fontFamily":"Consolas","fontSize":12,"lineHeight":1.4,"color":"#DCE6E1","align":["left","middle"]}},{"elementId":"req","elementType":"text","bounds":[480,318,424,44],"content":{"text":"需要 Node 22.12+ 和 pnpm 10.17。Windows 安装包和快捷方式由 scripts/Package-Huandeng.ps1 生成。","fontFamily":"Microsoft YaHei","fontSize":12,"lineHeight":1.5,"color":"#56615D","align":["left","top"]}},{"elementId":"rule","elementType":"line","bounds":[56,398,848,1],"viewBox":[848,1],"points":"0,0 848,0","border":{"width":1,"color":"#CBD3CF","style":"solid"},"arrow":[]},{"elementId":"repo","elementType":"text","bounds":[56,412,848,28],"content":{"text":"github.com/JaytonKogeru/huandeng","fontFamily":"Microsoft YaHei","fontSize":19,"lineHeight":1.3,"color":"#2E6B5E","align":["left","top"],"bold":true}},{"elementId":"repo-note","elementType":"text","bounds":[56,444,848,44],"content":{"text":"编辑器与插件 0.19。问题、测试和 PR 最有用的地方，是上一页列出的空白。这份介绍本身就是一个幻灯项目：claude-zh/deck.pptd。","fontFamily":"Microsoft YaHei","fontSize":13,"lineHeight":1.55,"color":"#56615D","align":["left","top"]}},{"elementId":"attribution-watermark","elementType":"text","bounds":[760,10,176,16],"content":{"text":"中文 · Claude Opus 5.5","fontFamily":"Microsoft YaHei","fontSize":10,"lineHeight":1.2,"color":"#7A8580","align":["right","middle"]}}]
notes: "想试试的话，打开编辑器新建一个项目，或者打开已有的 .pptd 文件，也可以直接打开项目文件夹。在助手连接里接上你已经在用的 AI 客户端。然后照我做这份介绍的方法来：先把你的故事讲给 agent，大声讲、想到哪说到哪，让它先整理故事，再做页面。之后一次只请它改一处：看预览，写入，再回看审阅。右边是代码和构建命令，最下面是仓库地址。谢谢大家。"
